        {
          "name": "Sign in platform admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "description": "JSON body. Invalid JSON → 400. Empty body parses as `{}` and becomes 401 (empty credentials)."
              },
              {
                "key": "x-school-host",
                "value": "{{adminHost}}",
                "description": "Must resolve to `admin.<rootHost>` after port strip. School / app / apex hosts → 403."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/session",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "session"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Issues an HMAC platform-admin session when credentials match `platform.admins` **and** the request is on the admin host.\n\n**Auth:** none on the request. Email is trimmed and lowercased (`normalizeAdminEmail`). Non-string or missing `email` / `password` become `\"\"` — there is **no field-level 400**. Bad or empty credentials → `401 { \"error\": \"Invalid email or password\" }` (same message; no email-format or password-complexity errors on this route). Bootstrap password rules apply only to the seed, not this handler.\n\n**Who:** the seeded platform operator only. School accounts cannot sign in here.\n\n**Host (required):** `isPlatformAdminHost` — `x-school-host` or `Host` must be `admin.{{rootHost}}` (e.g. `admin.e-school.et` or `admin.e-school.et:3000`). Otherwise `403 { \"error\": \"Admin login is only allowed on the admin host\" }`.\n\n**Side effects:** issues a new HMAC token (`SESSION_TTL_SECONDS`, default 28800). Does not persist a server-side session row; the token is the session. Does not set cookies (the Next console stores the token in a host-only cookie after this call).\n\n**Success `200`:** `{ email, token, expiresAt }` (`expiresAt` is ISO-8601). Copy `token` into `{{accessToken}}` (the test script does this).\n\n**Errors that exist:** 400 invalid JSON; 401 bad/empty credentials; 403 wrong host; 405 other methods.\n\n**Not used:** 404, 409, 422, and no distinct 500 from this handler."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('sign-in returns email, token, expiresAt', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.email).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.expiresAt).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  });",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 400) {",
                  "  pm.test('invalid JSON error', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Invalid JSON');",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
                  "  pm.test('bad credentials error', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Invalid email or password');",
                  "  });",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 403) {",
                  "  pm.test('admin host required', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Admin login is only allowed on the admin host');",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
